{
    "tutorial.title" : "How to play?",
    "tutorial.power.additionnal" : "Ready for a super-duper trick that goes with your nifty powers?",
    "tutorial.power.psychic" : "Ready to join the League? Grab and move objects or enemies with your mental powers, itâ€™s a no-brainer!",
    "tutorial.power.sharp" : "Swipe to slice and dice - enemies or objects - itâ€™s so nice!",
    "tutorial.power.brush" : "Draw shapes to foil your enemies and artfully move objects!",
    "tutorial.power.boom" : "Drag to aim and toss grenades to make enemies and objects go BOOM!",
    "tutorial.power.ninja" : "Drag to aim and shoot to kill enemies or hit objects, Super Star!",
    "tutorial.power.spirit" : "Draw a path to shoot enemies or objects - thatâ€™s the spirit!",
    "tutorial.power.portal" : "Your powers are outta sight! Tap to create portals to teleport enemies and objects.",
    "tutorial.hostage.psychic" : "Donâ€™t hurt a hostage, geniusâ€¦ or youâ€™ll fail!",
    "tutorial.hostage.sharp" : "Just donâ€™t slice a hostageâ€¦ or you wonâ€™t make the cut!",
    "tutorial.hostage.brush" : "Donâ€™t paint everyone with the same brush. Avoid hostages!",
    "tutorial.hostage.boom" : "Donâ€™t hit a hostageâ€¦ or youâ€™ll bomb out!",
    "tutorial.hostage.ninja" : "It takes a real ninja not to hit a hostage!",
    "tutorial.hostage.spirit" : "Thatâ€™s the spirit! Avoid hostages!",
    "tutorial.hostage.portal" : "Make sure you donâ€™t kill a hostage!",
    "tutorial.villain.x" : "Behold the power of Super X! Heâ€™s immune to your powers!",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond" : "Super Diamondâ€™s as hard as a rock. He wonâ€™t go down easy.",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.sharp1" : "Super Diamondâ€™s as hard as a rock. He wonâ€™t go down easy, sugar.",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.psychic" : "WOW. Anyone tell you your lines are super-cheezy?",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.sharp2" : "You really arenâ€™t that sweet, are you, Mr Bullet?",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.brush" : "You donâ€™t paint a pretty picture, do you?",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.boom" : "Pff! This test is super-breezy.",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.ninja" : "Neither do your lines.",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.spirit" : "Way to lift my spirits, man.",
    "tutorial.villain.diamond.portal" : "Wish I could make your one-liners vanish.",
    "narrative1.bullet" : "Are you a super-hero, or a super-zero?",
    "narrative1.bullet.sharp" : "Hey hot-shot, lookinâ€™ sharp.",
    "narrative1.psychic" : "Nah, Iâ€™m a super engineer-o.",
    "narrative1.sharp" : "Bet you say that to all the girls.",
    "narrative1.brush" : "Let me make this super-clear-o: your jokes suck.",
    "narrative1.boom" : "Nah, I need a super beer-o.",
    "narrative1.ninja" : "Anyone tell you youâ€™re a total super rear-o?",
    "narrative1.spirit" : "You seem super cavalier-o.",
    "narrative1.portal" : "Shove it, or Iâ€™ll zero in on you!",
    "narrative2.bullet" : "This oneâ€™s a real blastâ€¦ donâ€™t bomb out, Super Slacker!",
    "narrative2.bullet.sharp" : "If you make this level, youâ€™re a real bombshell.",
    "narrative2.psychic" : "You think Iâ€™m brainlessâ€¦ or heartless?",
    "narrative2.sharp" : "Aw, did you think I was brainlessâ€¦ or heartless, here?",
    "narrative2.brush" : "I didnâ€™t think this was paint by numbers, pal!",
    "narrative2.boom" : "Keep it up, and I just might explode.",
    "narrative2.ninja" : "You mean like your one-liners?",
    "narrative2.spirit" : "You canâ€™t break this spirit!",
    "narrative2.portal" : "Yet somehow my problems all justâ€¦ disappear.",
    "narrative3.bullet" : "Fail this one and itâ€™ll be a real blowout.",
    "narrative3.bullet.sharp" : "Pull this one off and youâ€™re a real knock-out.",
    "narrative3.psychic" : "You know, I really mind your puns.",
    "narrative3.sharp" : "Oooooh! Is that a dareâ€¦ or a pick-up line?",
    "narrative3.brush" : "Donâ€™t worryâ€¦ I wonâ€™t miss a stroke.",
    "narrative3.boom" : "Man, your lines BOMB.",
    "narrative3.ninja" : "Iâ€™d like to evade responsibility for this one.",
    "narrative3.spirit" : "Man, your jokes have no soul.",
    "narrative3.portal" : "Ha! I wonâ€™t leave a trace.",
    "tutorial.sniper" : "Wait a minute! Let's learn about the sniper rifle!"
